================================================================================
                    TDS AUTOMATION API: TECHNICAL DOCUMENTATION
================================================================================

[ CORE ENGINE METHODS ]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TDS:Place(name, x, y, z, ...)       -> Places tower, returns index (1-based).
TDS:Upgrade(idx, path)              -> Upgrades tower at index (path 1 or 2, default: 1).
TDS:Sell(idx, req_wave)             -> Sells tower at index (optional wave delay).
TDS:SellAll(req_wave)               -> Sells all placed towers (optional wave delay).
TDS:SetTarget(idx, mode, req_wave)  -> Targeting: "First", "Strong", "Last", "Weak", "Random".
TDS:Loadout(...)                    -> Equips towers by name (e.g. TDS:Loadout("Scout", "Farm")).
TDS:Mode(difficulty, code)          -> Joins mode / map matchmaking or enters private server.
TDS:GameInfo(map, modifiers)        -> Selects the desired Map and Modifiers.
TDS:StartGame()                     -> Ready up in the lobby matchmaking elevator.
TDS:Ready()                         -> Votes ready on the match start prompt.
TDS:GetWave()                       -> Returns current wave number (integer).
TDS:WaitForWave(target_wave)        -> Pauses execution until target wave is reached.
TDS:VoteSkip(start_wave, end_wave)  -> Votes to skip waves. Ex: TDS:VoteSkip(1) or TDS:VoteSkip(1, 40).
TDS:UnlockTimeScale()               -> Unlocks 2x time scale using Speed Tickets.
TDS:TimeScale(val)                  -> Cycles time scale to: 0, 0.5, 1, 1.5, or 2.
TDS:RestartGame()                   -> Votes to replay/restart match at the game-over screen.
TDS:AutoChain(...)                  -> Automatic Commander chain with timescale awareness.
TDS:MedicSelect(medic_idx, tgt_idx) -> Directs Medic at medic_idx to cleanse/heal tgt_idx.
TDS:MedicChain(...)                 -> Automatic Medic chain micro using external chaining module.
TDS:ResetAllStates()                -> Clears placed towers, upgrade history, and logs.
TDS:RunStrategy()                   -> Replays recorded actions from 'ADS_LastStrat.lua'.
TDS:Addons(skip_lobby_check)        -> Loads external premium features / progression modules.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ MODIFIERS & GAME INFO ]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Usage: TDS:GameInfo("Simplicity", {HiddenEnemies = true, ExplodingEnemies = true})

Valid Modifiers List:
• HiddenEnemies     • Glass             • ExplodingEnemies  • Limitation
• Committed         • HealthyEnemies    • Fog               • FlyingEnemies
• Broke             • SpeedyEnemies     • Quarantine        • JailedTowers
• Inflation

Note: Pass table as key-value ({JailedTowers = true}) or array ({"JailedTowers"}).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ TDS:Mode (MATCHMAKING MODES) ]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Usage: TDS:Mode("Fallen") or TDS:Mode("Molten", "PRIVATE_SERVER_CODE")

Available Modes & Maps:
• Standard Survival : "Easy", "Molten", "Intermediate", "Fallen"
• Hardcore / Void   : "Hardcore" (Easy), "Voidcore" (Hard)
• Special Gamemodes : "PizzaParty", "Badlands", "PollutedWasteland"
• Event Difficulties: "DuckyEasy", "DuckyHard"
• Trials Mode       : "Trial"

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ TDS:SetOption ]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description: Used for towers with configurable unit spawns, tracks, or traps.
Usage: TDS:SetOption(index, "OptionName", "Value", requiredWave)

1. Mercenary Base:
   - "Unit 1", "Unit 2", "Unit 3" --> "Grenadier", "Rifleman", "Riot Guard", "Field Medic"

2. Trapper:
   - "Trap" --> "Spike", "Landmine", or "Bear Trap"

3. DJ Booth:
   - "Track" --> "Green", "Red", or "Purple"

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ TDS:Ability ]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description: Triggers tower special abilities. Set 'loop' to true for auto-spam.
Usage: TDS:Ability(index, "AbilityName", dataTable, loop)
Shortcut: TDS:Ability(index, "AbilityName", true) -- Automatically loops

• Commander:
  - "Call Of Arms" (No data required)
  - "Support Caravan" (No data required)
  - Pro-tip: Use TDS:AutoChain(idx1, idx2, idx3) instead for automatic cycling!

• DJ Booth:
  - "Drop The Beat" (No data required)

• Medic:
  - "Ubercharge" (No data required)
  - Pro-tip: Use TDS:MedicSelect(medicIdx, targetIdx) to direct healing.

• Necromancer:
  - "Raise The Dead" (No data required)

• Hacker:
  - "Hologram Tower"
    Data: { 
        towerToClone = cloneIdx, 
        towerPosition = Vector3.new(x, y, z) -- or { Vector3.new(...), Vector3.new(...) } for random
    }

• Pursuit:
  - "Patrol" 
    Data: { ["position"] = Vector3.new(x, y, z) }

• Gatling Gun:
  - "FPS"
    Data: { ["enabled"] = true / false }

• Brawler:
  - "Reposition"
    Data: { ["position"] = Vector3.new(x, y, z) }

• Mercenary Base:
  - "Air-Drop"
    Data: { 
        ["pathName"] = 1, 
        ["dist"] = 0 to 200, -- (Simplicity Max: 156)
        ["directionCFrame"] = CFrame.new() 
    }

• Military Base:
  - "Airstrike"
    Data: { 
        ["pathName"] = 1, 
        ["dist"] = 0 to 200, 
        ["pointToEnd"] = CFrame.new() 
    }

